WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:04,600
You dare to kick me

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,500
I don’t want to live in this base anymore

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:08,300
They are not from our base

4
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:14,760
I can support you from the base. Sorry.

5
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:18,200
I didn’t know you were here for outside support. Make friends and wait until it’s over.

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,360
I'll treat you to tea
